    "catalogue_description": "Changes: -NO LONGER REQUIRES T4M. -All weapons have been changed. -Reduced the chance of a boss spawning by a lot. -Reduced the number of targets for endgame from 15 to 5. -Reduced the number of targets for PAP from 5 to 3. -Scobalula\u2019s Max Ammo script that refills the clip. *Targets have not been moved* -Added a new Nightmare difficulty setting. -Probably harder than Octagon. -Increases the spawn rate. -Zombies become sprinters much faster. -Eventually they become tranzit sprinters. -Few bugs (I\u2019ll fix them eventually ) -Song bears don\u2019t make sound. -2 Walls weapons are untextured white, oh well. -*Report any other bugs plz*",
